                    <component thickness="OTBar_HDI_Prepreg_thickness" width="OTBar_HDI_width" r="0." material="Prepreg" vis="OTBarHDIVis"/>
                </components>
                <comment> Works, placement seems believeable, update: color, thickness, material, radius? </comment>


